}

/**
 * Runs `fn` while holding an exclusive `<filePath>.lock` file, so concurrent
 * CLI processes cannot interleave their read-modify-write cycles. Waits up to
 * `timeoutMs` for the lock; locks untouched for `staleLockMs` are reclaimed.
